and the grocery store to pick it up from please pick up groceries for me today. And she sent me a long list of groceries and the grocery store to pick it up from with very specific instructions. And that was not very convenient. She didn't ask me if I had the time and I had to juggle a fair bit. And I dashed across town to pick up groceries from that particular store.

