very often you feel really resentful towards the other person. You feel angry and frustrated. And that is something that is worth thinking about. That when we say yes to the things that we don't want to do, it often leaves us very grumpy, very unhappy and resentful to the other person. I mean, and this is along the lines of what happened with you and your friend when your friend asked you to pick up groceries and I think you wanted to say no, but you said yes.

